        "created_at": "2015-01-07T21:59:50.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I just got my preorder box and was looking at some of the new cards. I noticed something weird in my Prime Warden Haka card. The text on the power in my card says:</p><blockquote><p><span>POWER: Play a card. If that card has \"Haka\" in the title, select one target to gain the benefit of your discarding.</span></p></blockquote><p>The text is different from the one I've seen online and the discard part doesn't make much sense. What's up with this?</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:43:13.979Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
