        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>I just got my preorder box and was looking at some of the new cards. I noticed something weird in my Prime Warden Haka card. The text on the power in my card says:</p><blockquote><p><span style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px; background-color: rgb(235, 233, 234);\">POWER: Play a card. If that card has &quot;Haka&quot; in the title, select one target to gain the benefit of your discarding.</span></p></blockquote><p>The text is different from the one I&#39;ve seen online and the discard part doesn&#39;t make much sense. What&#39;s up with this?</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
