        "raw": "[quote=\"fabikw\"]\n\nI just got my preorder box and was looking at some of the new cards. I noticed something weird in my Prime Warden Haka card. The text on the power in my card says:\n<blockquote>POWER: Play a card. If that card has &quot;Haka&quot; in the title, select one target to gain the benefit of your discarding.\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote>\nThe text is different from the one I&#39;ve seen online and the discard part doesn&#39;t make much sense. What&#39;s up with this?&nbsp;\n\n[/quote]\n\nIt was altered slightly for printing. Happens during PTing\n\nIt makes sense when you think about it. Haka plays one of his &quot;Haka&quot; cards. Draws 2, then discards X cards. He then chooses a target to gain the benefitial effect of that discarding, whether it be damage reduction from Shielding, healing, or damage from Battle\n",
