        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/f/ea5d25/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2015-01-07T22:06:01.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>It makes sense. I forgot that \"Haka\" cards act with Haka discarding cards to provide an effect. It makes the power completely different from the one that I had seen.</p>",
