      {
        "id": 125821,
        "name": "Matchstickman",
        "username": "Matchstickman",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/matchstickman/{size}/1880_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-01-07T22:14:12.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>For completeness I'm copy/pasting my answer from BGG too.</p><p>Yes it's correct. Yes it makes sense.</p><p>There was a big debate in the playtesting forum on the wording and that is what they have gone for. The debate was about who did the discarding to power the Haka card, the recipient of the bonus or Haka himself, the current wording makes it clear(er) who discards.</p><p>Example</p><p><strong>Prime Warden Haka</strong> uses his Guardian power to play a card. The card he plays is <em>Haka of Battle</em></p><p>Haka of Battle reads \"Draw 2 cards, then discard 1 or more cards. Increase the next Damage dealt by Haka by 1 for each card discarded this way.\"</p><p><strong>Prime Warden Haka</strong>&nbsp;draws the 2 cards.</p><p><strong>Prime Warden Haka</strong>&nbsp;discards 1 or more cards.</p><p><strong>Prime Warden Haka</strong>&nbsp;can chose any target, Hero, Environment or Villain, to receive the bonus damage from the discard on his&nbsp;<em>Haka of Battle</em>&nbsp;card.</p><p>Example 2</p><p><strong>Prime Warden Haka</strong>&nbsp;uses his Guardian power to play a card.</p><p>The card&nbsp;<strong>Prime Warden Haka&nbsp;</strong>plays is <em>Vitality Surge</em></p><p>This is not a card with <em>Haka</em> in the title so only the hero&nbsp;<strong>Prime Warden Haka</strong>&nbsp;can gain 2 HP and draw a card.</p>",
        "post_number": 5,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:00:05.821Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 1,
        "reads": 0,
        "readers_count": 0,
        "score": 5.0,
        "yours": false,
        "topic_id": 11840,
        "topic_slug": "prime-warden-haka-errata",
        "display_username": "Matchstickman",
        "primary_group_name": "playtesters",
        "flair_name": "playtesters",
        "flair_url": "/uploads/default/original/1X/f46928191dbf93b4d0df24571543f49779579225.png",
        "flair_bg_color": "",
        "flair_color": "",
        "flair_group_id": 41,
        "badges_granted": [],
        "version": 1,
        "can_edit": false,
